O2I9nK8fE85p6ewA3zkBRmz2_yizjqv_sN-_A&oe=69E4D6F6"}, {"file_name": "AssaultOnBase.png", "id": "443113451591277", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982544_443113454924610_3676545296571915906_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nT6fCNgGPHYQ7kNvwHUCyKi&_nc_oc=Adqo6PLSg_6wXLN0eh0EDeXtE10EVgs90g4wEFfSGZLlcLkJbOw5R01NexG5GH17a74&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af11LaUSqFuWBp1satc81RLDbeFBiUG3chzYGdMo-g_nZA&oe=69E4D346"}, {"file_name": "Labyrinth.png", "id": "1300393411339063", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982674_1300393414672396_5204739748604220557_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tnsJaBhUuU4Q7kNvwG8AW25&_nc_oc=AdpvsjmBqtAHxj2XyB9u2ss8wQEBAxkYLpaScDyR3Ej5ihQQ0OdwaJ3rulJgN9uQ4IE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3deTNz51NgYZitX_k7FK1wtB4TA7Tbl00leAB-4aR0sw&oe=69E4E108"}, {"file_name": "Turret.png", "id": "2302745436726053", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974751_2302745440059386_4335230081335400553_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XbK7yWyhxrkQ7kNvwEZsi57&_nc_oc=AdpOk6zRjgcV_A5h3e-IrZDIaXp6yYlmX9cVOrJKe3BtGbPOEAyVd7nZHNWAi2mAaDA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af221_izfhnhWeNY0rljPqBoXor8cjgXQkFH0qH68pV54Q&oe=69E4CEDF"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArtLandscape.png", "id": "1083730483394050", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86615253_1083730486727383_4084447030365624247_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ap6eEquTbeQQ7kNvwFaOWIM&_nc_oc=AdosdCV5ANIX_xUB0mWt7v0LtHZ-aqZOarltabNob1UzqGT7ziignMJMM1A2BNUOJ7o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af3yd7asTMORIzZkx9zK9imVanXUiSfyZoj46Gz2C0YsEw&oe=69E4E7AB"}, "display_name": "Catastrophic Inversion", "keywords": ["Arena", "Laser", "Cyber", "Huge", "Neon"], "long_description": "Catastrophic Inversion is a VR laser-tag experience built for large spaces, like the gym at your school or community center.\nInstead of using a joystick or teleporting, you **walk naturally around the maps**, alongside the other players.\nWith two simple taps to calibrate, everyone is lined up and ready to go.\n\n**PLEASE NOTE:** in order to play in shared space on maps larger than 33' x 33'. you will need to have your headset in **Developer Mode** so you can temporarily disable the Guardian boundary.\nThis can be done in the **Headset Settings** on the **Meta Horizon** mobile app. You will need to create a meta developer account, but anyone can do this even if they aren't a developer.\n\n**Take on your friends** in several exciting locations in a **neon cyber world!**\n\n- One-time setup of a space takes only a few minutes.\n- If you don't have a large space, you can play in joystick mode.\n- Multiplayer is hosted locally and can be done without an internet connection. (LAN Wi-Fi connection still required.)\n\nCatastrophic Inversion is still in early access. There are some quality-of-life updates and much more content on the way, but currently the game offers:\n- Four Weapon Types (Including Powered Turrets)\n- Customizable Game Modes (CTF/Deathmatch/Elimination, timed/scored, teams/free-for-all)\n- Two 89' x 50' maps\n- One 79' x 46' map\n- One 33' x 33' map\n- One 10' x 10' demo platform for testing the Shared Space features at home.", "short_description": "Grab your friends, bring your headsets, and head to the biggest space you can find!\n\nCatastrophic Inversion is a cyber-themed shooter that allows you to turn any large space into an immersive multiplayer VR experience rivaling professional venues."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/policies", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/policies", "publisher_name": "Toastid Waffel", "support_website_url": "https://www.toastidwaffel.com/about-us", "